{"at": "2026-11-11T15:55:21.480123+00:00", "event_id": "01M75N4A08ET883CHS2SXS0DMN", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "cli", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M75N4A07HT273XMSQW21JCJ5", "input_key": "cutover_trigger", "mission_id": "01M75N3EP8TZGK6HW8Y5JYYW9Y", "mission_slug": "docsite-cutover-01M75N3E", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": [], "origin_flow": "specify", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "SPECIFY", "question": "What publishes the docsite after cutover, and when?", "recorded_at": "2026-11-11T15:55:21.480123Z", "run_id": "01M75N4A07HT273XMSQW21JCJ5", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-11T15:55:21.479317Z", "step_id": "specify.scenario.actor-trigger"}}
{"at": "2026-11-11T15:55:23.930440+00:00", "event_id": "01M75N4CCTYMJBG4D171V0JQJK", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M75N4A07HT273XMSQW21JCJ5", "final_answer": "Every push to main that touches a docsite input, and a plain workflow_dispatch, runs docs-pages.yml: the pages probe, then the doc-kitty build from the shared docs-site-build.yml with pages-artifact true, then the deploy from main of the core repository only, then the post-deploy smoketest. DocFX is no longer built or published by this workflow. Answered from the operator brief for #6938 PR B.", "mission_id": "01M75N3EP8TZGK6HW8Y5JYYW9Y", "mission_slug": "docsite-cutover-01M75N3E", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-11-11T15:55:23.930440Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M75N4A07HT273XMSQW21JCJ5", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-11T15:55:23.929717Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-11-11T15:55:26.365935+00:00", "event_id": "01M75N4ERX99A1XSWQYX1W255E", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "cli", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M75N4ERX99A1XSWQYX1W255D", "input_key": "smoketest_failure", "mission_id": "01M75N3EP8TZGK6HW8Y5JYYW9Y", "mission_slug": "docsite-cutover-01M75N3E", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": [], "origin_flow": "specify", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "SPECIFY", "question": "How does the post-deploy smoketest report a mismatch?", "recorded_at": "2026-11-11T15:55:26.365935Z", "run_id": "01M75N4ERX99A1XSWQYX1W255D", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-11T15:55:26.365111Z", "step_id": "specify.scope.smoketest"}}
{"at": "2026-11-11T15:55:28.928203+00:00", "event_id": "01M75N4H90S0WJ7DRNKDZXBM9E", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M75N4ERX99A1XSWQYX1W255D", "final_answer": "A job with needs: deploy, main only, read permissions only, runs python3 -m scripts.docs.site_live_probe https://docs.spec-kitty.ai after every deploy and fails the run on a mismatch. No auto-filed alert issue: the operator decided a red run is the signal, so #2361's optional alert issue is not adopted. Answered from the operator brief.", "mission_id": "01M75N3EP8TZGK6HW8Y5JYYW9Y", "mission_slug": "docsite-cutover-01M75N3E", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-11-11T15:55:28.928203Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M75N4ERX99A1XSWQYX1W255D", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-11T15:55:28.927152Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-11-11T15:55:31.349649+00:00", "event_id": "01M75N4KMNDRB8ZHTYT65RQR2E", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "cli", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M75N4KMMX9QZMATCPEYBCXVE", "input_key": "rollback_invariants", "mission_id": "01M75N3EP8TZGK6HW8Y5JYYW9Y", "mission_slug": "docsite-cutover-01M75N3E", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": [], "origin_flow": "specify", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "SPECIFY", "question": "What must always hold, and what must a revert restore?", "recorded_at": "2026-11-11T15:55:31.349649Z", "run_id": "01M75N4KMMX9QZMATCPEYBCXVE", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-11T15:55:31.348660Z", "step_id": "specify.rules.rollback"}}
{"at": "2026-11-11T15:55:33.789728+00:00", "event_id": "01M75N4P0XRN2RK74C3AZJDDFQ", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M75N4KMMX9QZMATCPEYBCXVE", "final_answer": "Deploy stays main-only and core-repository-only behind the pages probe-then-configure job, the pages concurrency group, least-privilege permissions and SHA pins; a failed doc-kitty build blocks the deploy; nothing publishes from a fork or off main. Rollback is reverting the PR (ADR D-13 step 4): the DocFX build path, docfx.json, toc.yml, the template and the DocFX scripts stay in the tree until #6943, and a revert restores the DocFX build and deploy jobs, the canary jobs and docs/llms.txt. docs/llms.txt is deleted with every live reference; immutable history is untouched. Answered from the operator brief.", "mission_id": "01M75N3EP8TZGK6HW8Y5JYYW9Y", "mission_slug": "docsite-cutover-01M75N3E", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-11-11T15:55:33.789728Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M75N4KMMX9QZMATCPEYBCXVE", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-11T15:55:33.788351Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
